  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-68eba769.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add arborio rice and cook, stirring, until coated, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-072f2d40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the water and vegetable stock powder. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.\n• Transfer risotto to a baking dish and cover tightly with foil.\n• Bake the risotto until the liquid is absorbed and the rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes. TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-42b4cd56.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Trim green beans, then slice into thirds. Slice zucchini into half-moons. Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Wipe out the frying pan and return to a medium- high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook green beans and zucchini, tossing, until tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add silverbeet and cook, stirring, until softened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-41db9638.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once the risotto is done, stir through a splash of water to loosen, if needed. Add basil pesto, the veggies and 1/2 the marinated goat cheese and stir to combine.\n• Add a drizzle of the oil from the marinated goat cheese tub. Season with pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-62e2789f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop walnuts.\n• Divide baked pesto and marinated goat cheese risotto between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with walnuts and remaining goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/632ba2612c49df7242041f30/step-fa30663f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
